    "text": "Command Center | The Paranormal Initiative Every Device is a Field Unit Each device running Paranormal Pro functions as a fully independent logging and investigation center. Every investigator captures EMF readings, motion events, audio sessions, photographs, and video recordings directly on their own device — fully timestamped and documented. Distributed field logging. Centralized command control. Designated Master Command Center One device may be designated as the Master Command Center. Team devices connect via secure Bluetooth synchronization. When investigation mode is activated, all connected devices begin logging simultaneously. When the investigation ends, all logging concludes together — creating a synchronized investigative record. Case Capsule Upload After the session, each investigator uploads their encrypted Case Capsule to the Master Command Center. All data is merged into a unified master evidence timeline, clearly labeled by: Investigator name Device origin Room or location investigated Exact timestamp of capture Multi-device investigations become one structured, defensible case record. Why It Matters Traditional investigations rely on disconnected equipment and manually synchronized notes. Paranormal Pro transforms your team into a coordinated investigative network — operating with precision, synchronization, and credibility."
