    "text": "Contact & Links | The Paranormal Initiative Contact & Links Connect with The Paranormal Initiative. Use this page to find our website, social links, video channels, publication spaces, and contact information. Whether you are interested in research, education, field investigation, EVP/ITC experimentation, haunted location study, contributor work, or advisory collaboration, this is the simplest place to start. Contact Us For questions, collaboration, contributor interest, advisory board inquiries, research discussions, media, or general contact, email The Paranormal Initiative. Email Us Copy Email paranormalinitiative@yahoo.com Ways To Connect Follow updates, join discussions, review new materials, and keep up with research, education, technology, and field-development work. Website Official Website The main home for The Paranormal Initiative, including research, education, standards, technology, and contributor resources. Open Website &rsaquo; Substack Publication space for updates, field articles, research notes, education, and longer-form writing. Open Substack &rsaquo; Facebook Page Official updates, announcements, posts, research direction, and public-facing Initiative material. Open Facebook Page &rsaquo; Facebook Group Community discussion space for paranormal investigation, research, education, and responsible exploration. Open Facebook Group &rsaquo; Rumble Video channel for discussions, updates, education, demonstrations, and paranormal research-related media. Open Rumble &rsaquo; Advisory Board Invitation Information for experienced investigators, researchers, educators, historians, technicians, and subject-matter contributors. Learn More &rsaquo; Contributor Invite Invite-only contributor setup for approved writers, researchers, and members contributing papers or materials. Contributor Access &rsaquo; Affiliates & Partners Recommended resources, affiliate links, and supporting partners. This area can be used for affiliate links, partner organizations, recommended tools, trusted resources, research-support services, and other links connected to The Paranormal Initiative's work. Affiliate Links Space for approved affiliate links, product resources, or services that support investigation, research, education, or documentation. Partner Resources Space for organizations, creators, teams, archives, publications, or educational resources connected to the wider work. Disclosure Affiliate or sponsored links should be clearly labeled so visitors understand when a link may support the site or Initiative. About The Initiative Education Center Advisory Board"
