    "text": "Field Articles | The Paranormal Initiative Education Center Field Articles Short educational articles for people learning the paranormal field. This area can hold readable pieces on haunted locations, folklore, equipment use, field habits, environmental factors, and responsible research. Education Center Haunted Locations Article Categories Haunted Location Research History, claims, access notes, structure context, folklore, and field-planning considerations. Equipment Notes Readable explanations of common field tools, what they measure, and what they cannot prove. Environmental Context Weather, pressure, humidity, airflow, sound, electricity, light, and ordinary causes that shape investigations. Folklore & Local Legend How stories travel, why they matter, and how to keep folklore distinct from documented historical fact. Field Habits Observation, notes, respectful access, team communication, safety checks, and review discipline. Research Notes Short reflections and updates from ongoing Paranormal Initiative research areas."
