    "text": "Haunted Locations | The Paranormal Initiative Location Research A developing haunted location directory for research, field notes, and exploration. The Haunted Location Directory is being prepared as a state-by-state resource for historic sites, reported claims, folklore, layout information, location data, access notes, and responsible weekend exploration planning. Open State Directory View Florida Directory Status This is a work in progress. The current directory includes 24 started state pages and 443 imported location entries, with placeholder pages reserved for the remaining states so the navigation can grow cleanly as research continues. Started State Directory Alabama 18 entries Alaska 11 entries Arizona 15 entries Arkansas 12 entries California 15 entries Colorado 22 entries Connecticut 14 entries Delaware 4 entries Florida 20 entries Georgia 15 entries Hawaii 10 entries Idaho 20 entries Illinois 18 entries Indiana 19 entries Iowa 16 entries Kansas 21 entries Kentucky 20 entries Louisiana 46 entries Maine 31 entries Maryland 32 entries Massachusetts 23 entries West Virginia 11 entries Wisconsin 12 entries Wyoming 18 entries State-by-State Listings Organized entries for locations, claims, history, access notes, and investigation suitability. History & Folklore Local legends, documented history, reported activity, and source notes kept distinct from verified facts. Structure Layout Room notes, building context, outdoor areas, environmental factors, and safe observation points. Field Notes Investigator observations, equipment considerations, baseline concerns, and follow-up research questions. Exploration Planning Weekend trips, photography, kayaking routes, forgotten places, local legends, and practical access research. Ethical Access Respect property, local rules, client privacy, historic preservation, safety boundaries, and community trust."
