    "text": "Honorary Member Collections | The Paranormal Initiative Education Center · Honorary Member Collections Honorary Member Collections Dedicated research collections for people whose work has shaped EVP, ITC, psychical research, survival research, anomalous communication studies, and the historical study of the field. Current Collections Each collection can include a professional profile, readable papers, source links, historical notes, and related Education Center material. Comments belong on the individual papers and articles so discussion stays connected to the specific work being read. EVP / ITC Honorary Member Collection Anabela Cardoso A dedicated collection for Dr. Cardoso's EVP, ITC, animal voice, radioelectric-frequency, and survival-hypothesis research. Open Collection Future Historical Profiles This area is built to expand carefully. Future collections may include historical EVP and ITC figures such as Friedrich Jurgenson, Konstantin Raudive, Marcello Bacci, Sarah Estep, George Meek, William O'Neil, Hans Bender, Raymond Bayless, Attila von Szalay, and others when source rights, citations, and publication boundaries are clear. EVP / ITC Topic Shelf Back to Education Center"
